00:40:40.807 --> 00:40:44.344
AND IS SET ANNUALLY BY THE DEPARTMENT OF HOUSING AND URBAN

00:40:44.344 --> 00:40:47.547
DEVELOPMENT. THIS IS THE SAME STANDARD THAT

00:40:47.547 --> 00:40:48.882
IS ALREADY UTILIZED IN CITIES LIKE LOS ANGELES, OAKLAND

00:40:48.882 --> 00:40:52.152
AND BERKELEY. THANK YOU TO THE ANTI

